01/api/stats/decks\ncurl http://localhost:3001/api/stats/daily?days=30\n\n# 访问 UI\nopen http://localhost:3001\n```\n\n**状态**: ✅ 所有 API 正常工作\n\n---\n\n## 📦 依赖包\n\n```json\n{\n  \"multer\": \"^1.4.5-lts.1\",\n  \"jszip\": \"^3.10.1\",\n  \"chart.js\": \"^4.4.0\" (CDN)\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 访问方式\n\n1. 启动服务：`cd web && node server.js`\n2. 访问地址：http://localhost:3001\n3. 新功能入口：侧边栏新增\"模板\"、\"媒体\"、\"导出\"菜单\n4. 统计图表：点击\"统计\"查看增强版图表\n\n---\n\n**版本**: v3.0.0  \n**完成时间**: 2026-02-27  \n**状态**: ✅ 生产就绪\nEOF\ncat /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/PHASE3_SUMMARY.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":60304,"output":1007,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":61311,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772180648111}}
